#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:4
msgid "Jobs"
msgstr "Trabajos"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:8
msgid "Provisioning: Jobs"
msgstr "Aprovisionamiento: Jobs"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:10
msgid "**None:** Cannot access |ProJob| > Jobs tab"
msgstr "**None:** Cannot acceso |ProJob| > Jobs pestaña"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:11
msgid ""
"**Read:** Can access |ProJob| > Jobs tab but cannot create, edit, or "
"delete Jobs"
msgstr ""
"**Read:** Puede acceso |ProJob| > Jobs pestaña pero cannot crear, editar, o "
"eliminar Jobs"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:12
msgid "**Full:** Full permissions to create, view, edit, and delete Jobs"
msgstr "**Full:** Full permisos to create, view, edit, and delete Jobs"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:14
msgid "Provisioning: Job Executions"
msgstr "Aprovisionamiento: Job Executions"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:16
msgid "**None:** Cannot access |ProJob| > Job Executions tab"
msgstr "**None:** Cannot acceso |ProJob| > Job Executions pestaña"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:17
msgid ""
"**Read:** Can access and view |ProJob| > Job Executions tab including job"
" execution history, status, and Job output"
msgstr ""
"**Read:** Can access and view |ProJob| > Job Executions tab including job "
"ejecución history, status, and Job output"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:22
msgid "Creating Jobs"
msgstr "Creating Jobs"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:24
msgid ""
"Jobs require existing Tasks or Workflows. See the appropriate section of "
"|morpheus| docs for more on creating `Tasks "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/provisioning/automation/automation.html#tasks>`_"
" and `Workflows "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/provisioning/automation/automation.html#workflows>`_."
msgstr ""
"Jobs require existente Tareas or Flujos de trabajo. See the appropriate "
"section of |morpheus| docs para más on creating `Tasks "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/provisioning/automation/automation.html#tasks>`_ "
"and `Workflows "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/provisioning/automation/automation.html#workflows>`_."

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:26
msgid "To create a new Job:"
msgstr "A crear un nuevo Job:"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:28
msgid "Navigate to |ProJob|"
msgstr "Navegue a |ProJob|"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:29
msgid "Select :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Seleccionar :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:30
msgid "Enter the following"
msgstr "Enter las siguientes"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:32
msgid "**NAME:** Name of the Job in |morpheus|"
msgstr "**NAME:** Nombre de el/la Job en |morpheus|"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:33
msgid ""
"**JOB TYPE:** A Task Job will execute a selected Task, a Workflow Job "
"will execute a selected Workflow"
msgstr ""
"**JOB TYPE:** A Tarea Job will execute a seleccionado Tarea, a Flujo de "
"trabajo Job will execute a seleccionado Flujo de trabajo"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:34
msgid "**ENABLED:** When checked, the Job will run as scheduled"
msgstr "**ENABLED:** Cuando checked, el/la Job será ejecutar as scheduled"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:36
#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:80
msgid "Select :guilabel:`NEXT`"
msgstr "Seleccionar :guilabel:`NEXT`"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:38
msgid "Configure the Job"
msgstr "Configurar el/la Job"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:78
msgid "Task Jobs"
msgstr "Trabajos de tarea"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:41
msgid ""
"**TASK:** Select target Task. If relevant to the Task, Input fields will "
"be presented"
msgstr ""
"**TASK:** Select target Tarea. If relevant to the Tarea, Input fields será "
"presented"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:58
#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:70
msgid "**SCHEDULE:**"
msgstr "**SCHEDULE:**"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:44
msgid ""
"Manual: Job is not scheduled but can be executed from |ProJob| and "
"selecting Actions > Execute"
msgstr ""
"Manual: Job is not scheduled but puede ser executed from |ProJob| and "
"selecting Actions > Execute"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:46
#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:66
msgid ""
"Date And Time: Job will be executed at one specific point in time and not"
" again (unless rescheduled or executed manually)"
msgstr ""
"Date Y Time: Job será executed en one specific point en time y no again "
"(unless rescheduled o executed manually)"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:48
#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:68
msgid ""
"Schedule: Select a configured Execution Schedule. Execution Schedules are"
" created in |LibAutExe|"
msgstr ""
"Schedule: Select a configured Execution Schedule. Execution Schedules are "
"creado in |LibAutExe|"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:50
#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:70
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides two default execution schedules, ``Daily at "
"Midnight`` and ``Weekly on Sunday at Midnight``. Any additional schedules"
" were created by a User. Additional schedules can be added in |LibAutExe|"
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| proporciona two default ejecución schedules, ``Daily at "
"Midnight`` y ``Weekly on Sunday at Midnight``. Cualquier adicional "
"schedules fueron creado por un Usuario. Additional schedules puede ser "
"added en |LibAutExe|"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:52
#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:72
msgid ""
"**INCLUDE POWER STATE:** Select All, On, or Off. The default "
"configuration is \"All\" and indicates the Job will run on all relevant "
"Instances or servers at the proper schedule time. Selecting \"On\" or "
"\"Off\" indicates the Job should only run against targets specifically "
"having either an on or off power state"
msgstr ""
"**INCLUDE POWER STATE:** Seleccionar Todos, En, o Off. El/La default "
"configuración es \"Todos\" y indicates el/la Job será ejecutar en todos "
"relevant Instancias o servidores en el/la proper schedule time. Selecting "
"\"En\" o \"Off\" indicates el/la Job should solo ejecutar against targets "
"specifically having either un en o off power state"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:54
#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:74
msgid "**CONTEXT TYPE:** Server or Instance"
msgstr "**CONTEXT TYPE:** Server or Instancia"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:56
#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:76
msgid ""
"**CONTEXT SERVER/INSTANCE:** Select the Server or Instance you wish to "
"target with the Job"
msgstr ""
"**CONTEXT SERVER/INSTANCE:** Seleccione el Server or Instancia you wish to "
"target with the Job"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:58
#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:78
msgid ""
"**RUN NOW:** When checked, the Job will execute on save regardless of "
"``SCHEDULE`` setting."
msgstr ""
"**RUN NOW:** Cuando checked, el/la Job será execute en guardar regardless "
"de ``SCHEDULE`` setting."

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:78
msgid "Workflow Jobs"
msgstr "Trabajos de flujo de trabajo"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:61
msgid ""
"**WORKFLOW:** Select target Workflow. If relevant to the Workflow, Input "
"fields will be presented"
msgstr ""
"**WORKFLOW:** Select target Flujo de trabajo. If relevant to the Flujo de "
"trabajo, Input fields será presented"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:64
msgid ""
"Manual: Job is not scheduled but can be executed from |ProJob| and "
"selecting ``Actions > Execute``"
msgstr ""
"Manual: Job is not scheduled but puede ser executed from |ProJob| and "
"selecting ``Actions > Execute``"

#: ../../provisioning/jobs/jobs_tab.rst:81
msgid "Select :guilabel:`COMPLETE`"
msgstr "Seleccionar :guilabel:`COMPLETE`"

